      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Illustrative translation of the MaterialToolbar title and overflow entry point; menu rendering remains native.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-toolbar\"><span>Near</span><button class=\"ds-overflow\" aria-label=\"More options\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"19\" r=\"1\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-toolbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;padding:0 8px;background:#f7f8f2;color:#1b211b;font:22px system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-overflow{display:grid;place-items:center;width:48px;height:48px;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:transparent;color:#1b211b;cursor:pointer}.ds-overflow:hover,.ds-overflow:active{background:#d6ecdc}.ds-overflow:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #286341;outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Window width selector",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "width-selected-light",
      "description": "Illustrative translation of the joined single-selection MaterialButtonToggleGroup. The native group requires a selection.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-width\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Window width\"><button aria-pressed=\"false\">Narrow</button><button aria-pressed=\"true\">Medium</button><button aria-pressed=\"false\">Wide</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-width{display:flex;border:1px solid #707b70;border-radius:999px;overflow:hidden;background:#f7f8f2}.ds-width button{flex:1;min-height:48px;padding:8px;border:0;border-right:1px solid #707b70;background:transparent;color:#1b211b;font:500 14px system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-width button:last-child{border-right:0}.ds-width button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#d6ecdc;color:#112d1c}.ds-width button:hover{background:#d6ecdc99}.ds-width button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #286341;outline-offset:-3px}.ds-width button:active{background:#d6ecdc}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Reading settings",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Illustrative translation of native sliders and countdown switch. Browser input styling is a panel approximation only.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-settings\"><label class=\"ds-setting-label\" for=\"ds-size\">Text size <output>26</output></label><input id=\"ds-size\" class=\"ds-range\" type=\"range\" min=\"18\" max=\"42\" value=\"26\" aria-label=\"Text size\"><label class=\"ds-countdown\"><span>3-second countdown</span><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"switch\" checked></label><p>Gives you a moment after you tap Play.</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-settings{background:#f7f8f2;color:#1b211b;font:16px system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-setting-label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px}.ds-setting-label output{color:#286341;font-size:14px}.ds-range{width:100%;min-height:48px;accent-color:#286341;cursor:pointer}.ds-countdown{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;min-height:56px;margin-top:20px}.ds-countdown input{width:40px;height:24px;accent-color:#286341;cursor:pointer}.ds-settings p{margin:0;color:#505d52;font-size:12px}.ds-range:focus-visible,.ds-countdown input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #286341;outline-offset:2px}.ds-range:hover,.ds-countdown:hover{filter:brightness(.97)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Reader preview",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "reader-preview",
      "description": "Illustrative static translation of ReaderView, showing its steady first-line band and 44 dp lower fade. Real text layout is Android StaticLayout.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-preview\"><div class=\"ds-preview-band\"></div><div class=\"ds-preview-text\">Take a breath. Look<br>toward the camera.<br><br>This is your space.</div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-preview{position:relative;height:156px;overflow:hidden;background:#111713;color:#f5f8f2;padding:0 18px}.ds-preview-band{position:absolute;top:12px;left:10px;right:10px;height:34px;border-radius:8px;background:#1f3024}.ds-preview-text{position:relative;padding-top:12px;font:500 26px/1.3 system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-preview:after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:auto 0 0;height:44px;background:linear-gradient(transparent,#111713)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Floating reader",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "reader-window",
      "description": "Illustrative static translation of the native overlay with expanded controls. CSS pixels represent dp one-to-one for this panel only; Android elevation, font scaling, gestures, countdown, and frame timing remain native.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-reader\" aria-label=\"Floating reader example\"><div class=\"ds-reader-header\"><span>Ready · 120 wpm</span><button aria-label=\"Close reader\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 6 12 12M18 6 6 18\"/></svg></button></div><div class=\"ds-reader-viewport\"><div class=\"ds-reader-band\"></div><div class=\"ds-reader-script\">Take a breath.<br>Look toward the<br>camera.</div></div><div class=\"ds-reader-playback\"><button aria-label=\"Restart script\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 4v6h6\"/><path d=\"M4.6 10A8 8 0 1 0 12 4\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-reader-play\" aria-label=\"Play script\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m7 4 13 8-13 8Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/></svg></button><button aria-label=\"Show or hide reader settings\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 6h18M3 18h18\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"6\" r=\"2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg></button></div><div class=\"ds-reader-adjust\"><div class=\"ds-reader-adjust-row\"><span>Text size 26</span><button aria-label=\"Smaller text\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/></svg></button><button aria-label=\"Larger text\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5v14\"/></svg></button></div><div class=\"ds-reader-adjust-row\"><span>Pace 120 wpm</span><button aria-label=\"Scroll slower\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/></svg></button><button aria-label=\"Scroll faster\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5v14\"/></svg></button></div></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-reader{width:320px;max-width:100%;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #3f4f43;border-radius:18px;background:#111713;color:#e3efe5;box-shadow:0 6px 12px #0003;font:12px system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-reader-header{display:flex;align-items:center;height:48px;padding-left:14px}.ds-reader-header span{flex:1;cursor:move}.ds-reader button{display:grid;place-items:center;flex-shrink:0;width:48px;height:48px;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:transparent;color:#e3efe5;cursor:pointer}.ds-reader button:hover{background:#b4edc433}.ds-reader button:active{background:#b4edc444}.ds-reader button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #b4edc4;outline-offset:-3px}.ds-reader-viewport{position:relative;height:152px;overflow:hidden;padding:0 18px}.ds-reader-band{position:absolute;top:12px;left:10px;right:10px;height:34px;border-radius:8px;background:#1f3024}.ds-reader-script{position:relative;padding-top:12px;color:#f5f8f2;font:500 26px/1.3 system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-reader-viewport:after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:auto 0 0;height:44px;background:linear-gradient(transparent,#111713)}.ds-reader-playback{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:0 6px 4px}.ds-reader-playback .ds-reader-play{flex:1;width:auto;border-radius:14px;background:#31503a}.ds-reader-adjust{padding:4px 6px 8px}.ds-reader-adjust-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.ds-reader-adjust-row+.ds-reader-adjust-row{margin-top:8px}.ds-reader-adjust-row span{flex:1;padding-left:8px}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Native Android workbench",
    "overview": "Near is a quiet, practical place to prepare words and read them close to the lens. Warm surfaces, forest green actions, system typography, and familiar Material 3 controls give editing and setup a clear hierarchy. The script is the main content; the interface stays compact and direct.\n\nThe signature is a dark floating reader with large warm-white text, a steady first-line focus band, and a bottom fade. Its header is a handle, its central control starts or pauses reading, and its small adjustment panel can be tucked away. This is a code-led native interface built with Java 17, Android views, and Material Components 1.13.0. There is no image composition or generated artwork behind the UI.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Native Material 3 editing and settings.",
      "Warm light and forest dark editor themes.",
      "An always-dark, movable reader with a stable reading line.",
      "Persistent preparation action and plainly labeled reading controls.",
      "Native density, font scaling, insets, and frame-timed movement."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Constant Reader Rule",
        "body": "Keep the reading surface dark in both editor themes, with warm-white script text and a fixed first-line band.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Native Scale Rule",
        "body": "Preserve system font scaling and wrapping; keep long settings and footer hints able to grow vertically.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Clear Target Rule",
        "body": "Preserve 48 dp floating targets and 8 dp gaps between independent controls when the window resizes or text scales.",
        "section": "layout"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do use native Material 3 controls and inherited text appearances for the workbench.",
      "Do keep the filled launch action available outside the scrolling preparation content.",
      "Do keep the reader dark, its first-line band stationary, and its large text responsive to system font scale.",
      "Do preserve 48 dp floating targets and 8 dp gaps between independent controls.",
      "Do respect native insets, reflow text, and pause before recomputing rotated reader geometry.",
      "Do use elapsed frame time for scrolling and keep countdown timing functional."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't replace native controls with a web wrapper or an image composition.",
      "Don't introduce a separate decorative font, illustration, or card system into this workbench.",
      "Don't use editor theme changes to invert the floating reader.",
      "Don't turn reader play, pause, or close into camera recording controls.",
      "Don't describe emulator screenshots as verification on the physical Pixel 7 Pro or Pixel Camera."
    ]
  }
}
